<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Open source · Apache-2.0 · Pre-alpha</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">AI agents inside your Nextflow pipelines. With evals and lineage.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      nf-agents is an open source toolkit for running AI agents inside Nextflow pipelines, with
      provenance and evals, in your own cloud account. The lineage tools are implemented and in
      review. Agent modules are planned for v0.2.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="#start">Try it in 5 minutes</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="#how">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figure class="flow-figure">
    <svg class="flow" viewBox="0 0 640 260" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-title flow-desc">
      <title id="flow-title">Diagram of the nf-agents data flow</title>
      <desc id="flow-desc">
        A Nextflow run calls an agent step. The agent step calls a model through nf-llm-replay.
        The same run writes a lineage store. nf-lineage-mcp reads that store and serves it to an
        MCP client.
      </desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path class="arrowhead" d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <path class="edge" d="M200 68 H284" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
      <path class="edge" d="M376 68 H396" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
      <path class="edge" d="M110 96 V172" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
      <path class="edge" d="M200 204 H256" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
      <path class="edge" d="M456 204 H476" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />

      <rect class="node" x="20" y="40" width="180" height="56" rx="10" />
      <text class="label" x="110" y="74" text-anchor="middle">Nextflow run</text>

      <path class="agent" d="M330 36 L362 68 L330 100 L298 68 Z" />
      <text class="caption" x="330" y="124" text-anchor="middle">Agent step</text>

      <rect class="node" x="396" y="40" width="224" height="56" rx="10" />
      <text class="label" x="508" y="74" text-anchor="middle">nf-llm-replay</text>

      <rect class="node" x="20" y="172" width="180" height="56" rx="10" />
      <text class="label" x="110" y="206" text-anchor="middle">Lineage store</text>

      <rect class="node" x="256" y="172" width="200" height="56" rx="10" />
      <text class="label" x="356" y="206" text-anchor="middle">nf-lineage-mcp</text>

      <rect class="node" x="476" y="172" width="144" height="56" rx="10" />
      <text class="label" x="548" y="206" text-anchor="middle">MCP client</text>
    </svg>
    <figcaption>
      Model answers are recorded once and replayed in tests, so no API key is needed. The
      lineage server is read-only.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

